#
#   blocking_algorithms_2 - ContentSecurityPolicy's checks of inline behavior, string and
#   WebAssembly compilation, and <base>
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/ContentSecurityPolicy/BlockingAlgorithms.cpp (lines 398-742):
#       should_elements_inline_type_behavior_be_blocked_by_content_security_policy,
#       ensure_csp_does_not_block_string_compilation, ensure_csp_does_not_block_wasm_byte_compilation
#       and is_base_allowed_for_document. Region r28 ported the inline and <base> checks for phase
#       1 (a connected <style>, an element with an event handler content attribute and a
#       <base href> reach them); region p2e ported the rest. String compilation needs
#       TrustedTypes (phase 3), WebAssembly compilation its CompileError (phase 4).
